g每2周一次，两组继续稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗24周。主要疗效比较指标为第24周ACR20应答率。","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实提供合成试验药B为口服小分子合成靶点B抑制剂、目标人群、III期非劣效设计、给药方案和主要终点，可形成部分正文。作用机制详情、非临床药理学/毒理学和既往临床资料未在允许来源中提供，医学作者需补充后扩展理论依据。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_12d0891d6198666e","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b0a3e4593d76f1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c63e43f68405d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922154336_654dcab0","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_fb6641b821224481\n章节编号=3\n章节标题=研究目的和终点\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"2ecfa13515a361bb3cf7986f31c54e4b6c56fa72789768d2797da143c6c4a07f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","span_id":"span_sel_3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：评价合成试验药B联合甲氨蝶呤相较阳性对照联合甲氨蝶呤的疗效非劣效性；评价两组安全性与耐受性","quote_sha256":"098cca780e96183c5a55f47267cf510a01b0d7ef6083f80f7c9353374a8507ca","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_objectives"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"主要研究目的：证明第24周ACR20应答率方面合成试验药B不劣于合成阳性对照C。","quote_sha256":"a7a7200060f3ad25aef63483ba7fb712ec38921a481ff6fe0f75f7521e8bfb6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"次要研究目的：比较DAS28-CRP变化和ACR50应答。\n主要终点：第24周ACR20应答率。\n关键次要终点：第24周DAS28-CRP较基线变化。；第24周ACR50应答率。\n其他次要终点：第12周ACR20应答率。","quote_sha256":"03f03ec3f4274b590c0f07e6d56003b8bcc7da37915bc237e15a958885aa2877","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征和心电图具有临床意义的变化。\n特别关注的不良事件：严重感染和机会性感染。","quote_sha256":"6527f93379af7091d56cec2b817cdcade1890a24609e1278fc2483a757502d47","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标比较所有随机试验参与者第24周ACR20应答；因疗效不足接受救援治疗按复合策略计为无应答，单纯停用随机治疗采用治疗策略并通过多重插补处理缺失。","quote_sha256":"f7d2d6751b0042a8a9ae740f5d1a4dff9f4672a029a40a3fa2844a22ffd8fa36","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_estimand"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_3","span_project_objectives","span_project_primary","span_project_secondary","span_project_safety","span_project_estimand"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心、随机、双盲、双模拟、阳性对照、平行组III期非劣效研究，评价合成试验药B联合甲氨蝶呤与合成阳性对照C联合甲氨蝶呤在甲氨蝶呤应答不足的活动性类风湿关节炎成人受试者中的疗效与安全性。\n\n本研究的主要目的为证明第24周ACR20应答率方面合成试验药B联合甲氨蝶呤不劣于合成阳性对照C联合甲氨蝶呤。次要目的为比较第24周DAS28-CRP较基线变化和第24周ACR50应答率。\n\n主要终点为第24周ACR20应答率。关键次要终点为第24周DAS28-CRP较基线变化和第24周ACR50应答率。其他次要终点为第12周ACR20应答率。安全性终点包括TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征和心电图具有临床意义的变化。特别关注的不良事件为严重感染和机会性感染。\n\n主要估计目标比较所有随机试验参与者第24周ACR20应答；因疗效不足接受救援治疗按复合策略计为无应答，单纯停用随机治疗采用治疗策略并通过多重插补处理缺失。","rationale":"已确认研究事实提供主要目的、次要目的、主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点、安全性终点、特别关注的不良事件及主要估计目标策略；正文据此组织。医学作者需复核终点层级和估计目标表述与统计分析计划一致。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_fb6641b821224481","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b0a3e4593d76f1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c63e43f68405d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922154336_654dcab0","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_74b3258bbacb99d3\n章节编号=3.1\n章节标题=主要目的和主要终点\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=证明第24周ACR20应答率方面合成试验药B不劣于合成阳性对照C。\n第24周ACR20应答率。","quote_sha256":"3f50c6724f43dbfa96090aebf946d075a5f45edfcd8c0ee079cddfec4a851cb7","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","span_id":"span_sel_31"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"主要研究目的：证明第24周ACR20应答率方面合成试验药B不劣于合成阳性对照C。","quote_sha256":"a7a7200060f3ad25aef63483ba7fb712ec38921a481ff6fe0f75f7521e8bfb6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标比较所有随机试验参与者第24周ACR20应答；因疗效不足接受救援治疗按复合策略计为无应答，单纯停用随机治疗采用治疗策略并通过多重插补处理缺失。","quote_sha256":"f7d2d6751b0042a8a9ae740f5d1a4dff9f4672a029a40a3fa2844a22ffd8fa36","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：按非劣效界值-12个百分点、预期两组ACR20应答率均为60%、单侧α=0.025、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%失访，计划约520例；合成参数仅用于功能验收。","quote_sha256":"36b85faf8a56f22502a7077ea5c33130113ea022cbe828609e97e7b45ee1442f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集与符合方案集共同支持主要非劣效结论；以组间ACR20率差的双侧95%置信区间下限高于-12%判定非劣效。不开展期中分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。","quote_sha256":"3ea2a43e039c0b559a6a3c5378c18582d36d42cc6c5330ea45590d8107674c7a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_project_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_31","span_project_primary","span_project_estimand","span_project_sample","span_project_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要目的为证明第24周ACR20应答率方面合成试验药B联合甲氨蝶呤不劣于合成阳性对照C联合甲氨蝶呤。主要终点为第24周ACR20应答率。\n\n主要分析针对所有随机试验参与者，比较两组第24周ACR20应答率。采用非劣效检验，非劣效界值为-12个百分点，以组间ACR20率差的双侧95%置信区间下限高于-12%判定非劣效。全分析集与符合方案集共同支持主要非劣效结论。因疗效不足接受救援治疗按复合策略计为无应答，单纯停用随机治疗采用治疗策略并通过多重插补处理缺失。","rationale":"已确认研究事实提供主要目的、主要终点、非劣效界值-12个百分点、组间ACR20率差双侧95%置信区间下限高于-12%判定非劣效、全分析集与符合方案集共同支持主要结论以及缺失处理策略；正文据此撰写。医学作者需复核非劣效判定表述与统计分析计划一致。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（主要目的和主要终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、非劣效界值）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_74b3258bbacb99d3","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:05a8ec9b227bcbd847bc2b6d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:2